[en.DECISION_C01_AWAY_FROM_OFFICE]
Away From Office

[en.DECISION_C01_AWAY_FROM_OFFICE_desc]
Cozy Glow stays away from government affairs for a while, so that she can re-organize her thoughts and plans.

[en.DECISION_C01_AWAY_FROM_OFFICE_AWAY_TOOLTIP]
During this period, Cozy Glow will not be able to handle government affairs (certain national focus and decisions).

[zh.DECISION_C01_AWAY_FROM_OFFICE]
不问国事

[zh.DECISION_C01_AWAY_FROM_OFFICE_desc]
和煦光流远离国家事务一段时间，以便她能够重新整理她的思绪和计划。

[zh.DECISION_C01_AWAY_FROM_OFFICE_AWAY_TOOLTIP]
在此期间，和煦光流将无法处理国家事务（部分国策与决议）。
